Changelog: 14-11-2026 16:27:29

Release 0.1.0.

Changelog: 14-11-2026 16:13:12

Added. Upscaler Manager is an app of the Bazzite Console Suite (owner, 14-11-2026), the first in the portal's
Graphics tab: it downloads and builds HelixSR, the FSR 3.1 drop-in upscaler with DLSS-style networks, deploys it
into games and takes it out again, and sets up OptiScaler for games without FSR 3.1. Its installer has its test,
tools/installer-tests/upscaler.sh, and the wiki its chapter.
